GRAGRA 3 "[A-Z][a-zA-Z_$]*""[a-z_$]*" GEMBED "embedding" EMBMATCH 0
ELS 256 64

;
WA 4000 4000
WAWIN 454 439 796 592
SC 1673 1841
GR 8
